scope.inScope:
- Product entity (JPA) map dung bang; ProductDTO tra ra API (khong lo thong tin noi bo)
- ProductRepository (JpaRepository); ProductService; ProductController
- GET /api/products?page=0&size=8 -> {"content":[...], "totalPages":n, "totalElements":n, "page":0, "size":8}
- GET /api/products/{id} -> 200 + JSON, hoac 404 {"error":"Product not found"}
- Xu ly loi: 404 cho sai id; 500 tra JSON loi chung {"error":"Internal error"}
